ls, you must complete an objective to move on. Weather its trying to find a diamond and avoid a massive spider, or finding a shovel to escape this place, the horror levels are the main part of the game.\n\nTo buy cosmetics in-game, you must collect gold around the horror levels to receive in-game currency, enabling you to deck out your player.\n\nFind it here in Chimpmare!", "short_description": "You should definitely download Chimpmare, an awesome VR game that has 3 awesome game modes such as a terrifying horror, shop, and intense PvP action into one unforgettable experience. Whether you're exploring eerie environments that will keep you on edge, browsing unique in-game shops for upgrades, or battling other players in fast-paced combat, Chimpmare delivers nonstop thrills. Dive into the chaos and see if you can survive the nightmare!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/chimpmarevr/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "NightmanVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/chimpmarevr/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "9631172856995074"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"